  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="9a3707c1-de17-5fa8-91db-a83460381d03" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Route FacilityClosed events by source and detail type to a bounded queue consumer.&#10;Publish stable-ID closure/reopening events to two independent consumers.&#10;Recheck enabled building preferences immediately before sending; later opt-out cannot retract an accepted send.&#10;A delivery key is eventId/subjectId/channel; matching simulator replay returns one provider reference.&#10;Retain failed/skipped/accepted delivery outcomes for authorized replay; no real email or SMS.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
